!cache/.gitkeep

## Live runtime state - never commit.
## These change constantly on the host, so a committed copy goes stale within
## days and then overwrites good data the next time the working tree is reset.
## Backups live elsewhere: the photo metadata CSV is mirrored to the
## "TomCatBot Pics" worksheet every few minutes, the catabase CSV and
## profiles.json are rebuilt from the CatDatabase sheet on boot, and the
## feeding files are captured by the pre-update tarball in deploy/deploy.sh.
TomCatBot Pics.csv
cache/catabase/Catabase - CatDatabase.csv
cache/catabase/profiles.json
cache/feeding_checklist.ndjson
cache/feeding_schedule.ndjson

